{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー2015"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事地方制覇致しました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/28/6541440/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアバンドのリボンがぴょんってなってるところが踊るときぴょんぴょんしてるのが好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/28/6541440/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡、大阪公演にお越し下さった皆様本当にありがとうございましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"多々ハプニングもありつつ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年よりも皆さんと楽しい時間が過ごせたと思うし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの笑顔がオープニングからエンディングまでキラキラしていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山パワーをもらいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"充実した素晴らしい時間を過ごすことが出来ました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました(´；ω；｀)⭐️⭐️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/28/6541440/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや回の乃木坂工事中みて癒されたなう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神宮LIVEにモードを切り替えるぞ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/28/6541440/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も作ったよてるてる坊主！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おつむにお願い事書いたお手紙入れて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天道様にお願いしますヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも是非パワーを乃木坂46に届けて下さい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、玲奈さんの卒業LIVEにもこのパワーが届きますように"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2015/08/28/6541440/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}